WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.402
Only what matters should reach your brain.

00:03.875 --> 00:06.547
Your feeds bring about ninety articles a morning.

00:07.300 --> 00:08.774
You will not read ninety.

00:09.725 --> 00:11.325
Cyris reads every one.

00:11.325 --> 00:13.288
It keeps the few that matter to you.

00:14.075 --> 00:17.315
Sixteen reports of one story become one summary.

00:18.650 --> 00:22.390
Vote an article down, and later runs can skip the ones like it.

00:23.100 --> 00:24.238
Open source.

00:24.238 --> 00:26.325
Self-host locally or on Cloudflare.

00:26.325 --> 00:27.687
Any model, or none.

00:28.500 --> 00:29.963
And nothing is hidden.

00:29.963 --> 00:32.741
Every article it dropped is still one click away.

00:34.175 --> 00:34.700
Cyris.

00:34.700 --> 00:36.193
A digest you can finish.

